WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:01.618
- I just really think,

00:00:01.618 --> 00:00:02.963
I really believe this from 
the bottom of my heart,

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.486
I think we only live one time.

00:00:04.486 --> 00:00:08.030
And we don't act like it.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:15.125
In my 20s, I spent an enormous

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:18.717
amount of time hanging out
with 90-year-old people.

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:23.501
And it was unbelievably intense
for me as somebody who is so

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:27.249
ambitious at the time 
how many of them

00:00:27.249 --> 00:00:28.779
literally, one by one

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:32.511
at airport at airport, 
park or park, event or event,

00:00:32.511 --> 00:00:35.196
bar or bar every one of them

00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:37.546
to a T started with,

00:00:37.546 --> 00:00:39.646
"Tell me about your life?

00:00:39.646 --> 00:00:41.181
"I'm young kid.
I'm hungry.

00:00:41.181 --> 00:00:43.938
"You're old.
I want to know.

00:00:43.938 --> 00:00:45.177
"Tell me about your life."

00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:49.081
Every one of them, all of
them, started with "I wish."

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:50.581
They all wished.

00:00:50.581 --> 00:00:52.082
They wish they worked harder.

00:00:52.082 --> 00:00:53.973
They wished they spent
more time with their family.

00:00:53.973 --> 00:00:55.914
They wished they didn't listen
to their mom and did

00:00:55.914 --> 00:00:57.325
what they wanted to do.

00:00:57.325 --> 00:01:00.044
They wished, 
they wished, they wished.

00:01:00.044 --> 00:01:04.789
The biggest poison
in us is regret.

00:01:05.849 --> 00:01:07.401
It's poison.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:12.745
And I pushed so hard, so hard
and will through my vehicle

00:01:12.745 --> 00:01:16.949
which isn't meditation,
which isn't health and wellness

00:01:16.949 --> 00:01:18.552
which isn't nonprofit.

00:01:18.552 --> 00:01:19.848
My vehicle is business.

00:01:19.848 --> 00:01:22.581
You're more than welcome to
tell me how bad it is or

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:26.943
why you can't, because or 
what but it's just not true.

00:01:26.943 --> 00:01:31.170
Because if anybody ever
did it then you can too.

